{#
| Variable               | Type      | Description                                        |
|------------------------|-----------|----------------------------------------------------|
| component              | object    | merchant settings from twilight.json               |
| component.heading      | string    | section title                                      |
| component.subheading   | string    | section subtitle                                   |
| component.products     | Product[] | the TWO selected products (first two are used)     |
| component.mobile_layout| string    | phones: `slider` (one card + a peek) or `grid` (both, compact) |
| component.show_thumbnails | bool   | gallery thumbnails (the main image always shows)   |
| component.show_marquee | bool      | the «الأكثر مبيعًا» ribbon                          |
| component.marquee_text | string    | ribbon label                                       |
| component.show_rating  | bool      | the rating                                         |
| component.show_sold    | bool      | the «مباع N مرة» line                              |
| component.show_chips   | bool      | the «ماذا يوجد في البكج» boxes                     |
| component.show_price   | bool      | the price                                          |
| component.show_add     | bool      | the «اشترِ الآن» button                            |
| component.show_badge / show_wishlist / show_brand / show_qty | bool | nothing to switch since the revamp — the card has no badge, heart, brand line or stepper |
| position               | int       | sorting block                                      |

Two featured products side by side, each in the shared Product Hero card
(partials/qpack-card, the design of qissa-package) in its compact wide layout
(.qpack__card--compact: gallery beside the details, sized so both cards are
seen whole, same height, buttons aligned); phones get the stacked Figma mobile
card (290:8165). Every element is merchant-toggleable. Dynamic Salla data only.
#}
<section class="s-block qdhero" id="qdhero-{{ position }}">
    <div class="container">

        {# centered heading #}
        {% if component.heading or component.subheading %}
            <div class="qdhero__head">
                {% if component.heading %}<h2 class="qdhero__title">{{ component.heading }}</h2>{% endif %}
                {% if component.subheading %}<p class="qdhero__subtitle">{{ component.subheading }}</p>{% endif %}
            </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if component.products|length %}
        {# Mobile layout is merchant-chosen (desktop is always the 2-up grid):
           `slider` = one card plus a peek of the next, swipeable; `grid` = both
           packs side by side, compact. Pure CSS — the mode rides on a data
           attribute and scroll-snap does the rest. #}
        {% set qdh_mobile = component.mobile_layout|default('slider') %}
        <div class="qdhero__grid" data-qdh-mobile="{{ qdh_mobile }}">
            {% for product in component.products|slice(0, 2) %}
                {% include 'components.partials.qpack-card' with {
                    product: product,
                    card_class: 'qdhero__card qpack__card--compact',
                    name_tag: component.heading ? 'h3' : 'h2',
                    ribbon: component.show_marquee ? component.marquee_text|default(trans('blocks.qissa.best_seller')) : false,
                    show_thumbnails: component.show_thumbnails,
                    show_rating: component.show_rating,
                    show_sold: component.show_sold,
                    show_inside: component.show_chips,
                    show_price: component.show_price,
                    show_buy: component.show_add
                } %}
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
        {% endif %}

    </div>
</section>
